澜是我们第三年的采购，第一年盲买到第二年开始能介入定制处理，今年俺可是亲自亲手处理了两个批次（瑰夏水洗和帕卡玛拉水洗），这一期就把它们先拿出来给订阅用户尝尝鲜～它们都非常的干净和甜美！我非常满意！哈哈哈哈哈～（佐园的新产季批次最早也要到下个月底了，还有没处理的，还有没晒干的，还有静置中的，节奏会慢一点，敬请期待！）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n               以上7个品相，一共：5个16g小分享包+2个100g，之前有朋友说希望订阅里能有云南，这回有了，我非常有信心你们会很喜欢它们；之前也有朋友说核桃树的四重奏可不可以单独喝到里面的品相呀，这回也满足一下～新产季豆子陆续密集上新中；\n              </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n             这些豆子各自的详细信息，已经发布或者陆续公众号里发布出来\n            </section>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09ax1xgH4tnoj8XGcqcB0xq0qpiamG0OGs3xP4S0y0Off9n6e47StF5lXdg/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 556.1875px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n           关于订阅补充说明：\n          </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='padding-left: 1.5em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;width: 577.188px;list-style-type: circle;visibility: visible;'>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;clear: both;min-heig